{
 "_note": "Arranges the dictionary entities for this app's case model (owner D4: case = EP_EPISODE with one or more EP_PROCEDURES). scope: case = one or more rows per case; procedure = rows belong to one EP_PROCEDURES row; nest_under = rows inside a parent row. module = shown for a procedure when one of its PROCEDURE_COMPONENTS has these component types (or when it already has data). auto_parent = link filled automatically to the case's single row of that entity. later = not shown yet (built in that phase). Only arranges; never adds fields or codes. copy_forward = history fields copied from the same MRN's latest case the user can see when a new case is added (EP Workspace sections.json copy_forward); copied values are marked 'Copied' until checked. primary_fields = shown first, the rest under More fields; quick_events = these dictionary event types as Yes + date inside each parent row (EP Workspace light follow-up, O7). Follow-ups and outcome events belong to one procedure (index_event = that EP_PROCEDURES row).",
 "entities": {
  "PATIENT_IDENTIFIERS": {
   "scope": "case",
   "cardinality": "single",
   "label": "Identifiers",
   "copy_forward": [
    "full_name",
    "date_of_birth"
   ]
  },
  "PATIENTS": {
   "scope": "case",
